        A <span class="search-hit mathjax">Memory</span>-Efficient <span class="search-hit mathjax">Retrieval</span> Architecture for RAG-Enabled Wearable Medical LLMs-<span class="search-hit mathjax">Agents</span>
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Liao%2C+Z">Zhipeng Liao</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Shao%2C+K">Kunming Shao</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Yu%2C+J">Jiangnan Yu</a>, 
      
