    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Shumberger%2C+B+M">Brendan M. Shumberger</a>, 
      
