        A <span class="search-hit mathjax">Multi</span>-<span class="search-hit mathjax">agent</span> Large <span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> Model Framework to Automatically Assess Performance of a Clinical AI Triage Tool
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Flanders%2C+A+E">Adam E. Flanders</a>, 
      
