        <span class="search-hit mathjax">Retrieval</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Augmented</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Generation</span> (RAG) for Fintech: <span class="search-hit mathjax">Agentic</span> Design and Evaluation
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
