    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Seeing Through the MiRAGE: Evaluating Multimodal <span class="search-hit mathjax">Retrieval</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Augmented</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Generation</span>
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Martin%2C+A">Alexander Martin</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Walden%2C+W">William Walden</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Kriz%2C+R">Reno Kriz</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zhang%2C+D">Dengjia Zhang</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Sanders%2C+K">Kate Sanders</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Yang%2C+E">Eugene Yang</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Jin%2C+C">Chihsheng Jin</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Van+Durme%2C+B">Benjamin Van Durme</a>
      
